    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n20025" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βλᾰδᾰρός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ά</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πλαδαρός</span>
			, <i>flaccid</i>, cj. in <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				19.88
			</span></i>:—<i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i> has <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βλᾰδός</span></b>  and
				<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βλᾰδύς</span></b>  (which is prob.
			in <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
			</span></i>
			<i>Aër.</i><i><span class="en">
				20
			</span></i>). (With <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βλαδύς</span> cf. Skt.
				<i>mrdús</i> 'soft', Lat. <i>mollis</i>; cf.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μέλδομαι, ἀμαλδύνω</span>.)</div>
